# --- Scratch: pulled databases, seeded copies, experiment output ---
# A pulled SQLite file is the owner's real health data. Nothing here is ever committed (hard rule 1),
# and this line is what makes that a rule instead of a habit: M7.3 seeded a weight history into a copy
# of the live database to look at the chart, and that copy sat in the working tree as an untracked file.
tmp/